	#section__concept
		.secContainer
			.secPanel
				.secTtlBox
					.sub
						p CONCEPT
					.secTtl
						h2 コンセプト
				.txtBox01
					.txt
						p 人が本来もつ "ときめき、美意識" などの<br class="spBreak">内なる<em>感性</em>に寄り添い、<br class="spBreak">自分を更新し続ける。<br>高水準の労働環境で雑音を無くし<br class="spBreak">美容師の<em>本質</em>に向き合い<br>なりたい自分とありたい姿を叶える。<br>一人ひとりの感性に光を当て<br class="spBreak"> "次の自分" へ向かう原動力になる。
				.txtBox02
					dl
						dt Sensitivity and Essence
						dd We honor the inner sensibility each person naturally holds — their sense of excitement, beauty, and intuition — and support them in continually evolving themselves. By creating a highly supportive working environment free from unnecessary distractions, we allow hairstylists to focus on the true essence of their craft, and to realize both who they want to become and how they want to live. We shine a light on each individual's unique sensibility and become a driving force that leads them toward their next self.
